      "blockType": "Source",
      "rawSource": "\n\u0026UndoSecureText = \u0026Text\nIf \u0026UndoSecureText.Length() \u003E 0 AND (\u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027=\u0022) OR \u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027\u002B\u0022) OR \u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027-\u0022) OR \u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027@\u0022))\n\t\u0026UndoSecureText = \u0026UndoSecureText.Substring(2)\nEndIf\n",
      "cleanSource": "\n\u0026UndoSecureText = \u0026Text\nIf \u0026UndoSecureText.Length() \u003E 0 AND (\u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027=\u0022) OR \u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027\u002B\u0022) OR \u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027-\u0022) OR \u0026UndoSecureText.StartsWith(!\u0022\u0027@\u0022))\n\t\u0026UndoSecureText = \u0026UndoSecureText.Substring(2)\nEndIf"
    },
